{
  "about": "Changing the list of patterns (spec/shift-patterns.md). deleted: deleting pattern `id` takes it from `patterns`, takes the link from patterns that named it as `nextDay`, and takes it from the days that have it of their own (`own`, by date; \"\" is a day cleared on purpose), their memos staying. newJob: changing jobs; the new job's `incoming` patterns take over from the person's `own`, and an old one still on a day before the switch (`usedBefore`) stays after them. A ready-made pattern sharing an id with one of the person's that differs (name, mark, time, off, next day) and is still used before the switch keeps the person's id; the new job's takes a fresh one, which `sequence` (the new order) and next days use. Fresh ids are \"new-1\", \"new-2\"… in the order of `incoming`. `expected` lists the patterns by id, in order, with their next day.",
  "deleted": [
    {
      "name": "its days of their own lose it, keeping their memos, and links to it go",
      "patterns": [
        {
          "id": "night",
          "nextDay": "after"
        },
        {
          "id": "after"
        },
        {
          "id": "day"
        }
      ],
      "own": {
        "2026-10-01": {
          "shift": "night"
        },
        "2026-10-02": {
          "shift": "after"
        },
        "2026-10-03": {
          "shift": "after",
          "note": "病院"
        },
        "2026-10-04": {
          "shift": ""
        }
      },
      "id": "after",
      "expected": {
        "patterns": [
          {
            "id": "night"
          },
          {
            "id": "day"
          }
        ],
        "own": {
          "2026-10-01": {
            "shift": "night"
          },
          "2026-10-03": {
            "note": "病院"
          },
          "2026-10-04": {
            "shift": ""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an own day without a shift of its own stays",
      "patterns": [
        {
          "id": "day"
        },
        {
          "id": "off"
        }
      ],
      "own": {
        "2026-10-01": {
          "note": "棚卸し"
        }
      },
      "id": "day",
      "expected": {
        "patterns": [
          {
            "id": "off"
          }
        ],
        "own": {
          "2026-10-01": {
            "note": "棚卸し"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
